WEBVTT

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.070
Dear Chief,

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:38.340
Thank you very much for
helping out my kids and me.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:41.930
Their new Papa has
three kids of his own,

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.040
so our new home
is very lively.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.240
Taro and Hanako
are doing well.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.600
You take care, too, Chief.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.770
Please give my best regards
to everyone at Maison Ikkoku.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:53.850
-From Kasumi

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.450
That's great!

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:57.680
Yes.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.550
This calls for a celebration
in our usual way?

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.350
We're so predictable.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.550
Cheers!

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.540
Everyone! Please stop
disturbing Godai!

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.230
From doing what?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.980
He starts his final exams for graduation
the day after tomorrow.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.480
Graduation finals?

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:21.230
Did you know that?

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:25.780
How would I? It's not like
he's been studying at all

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.670
Are you all blind?!

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.640
This is a crucial time
that'll determine

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.510
whether or not
he'll graduate.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.560
Crucial time?

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.730
Not everyone faces
a "crucial time" every year

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.070
like this one does.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.390
What kind of "crucial time"
will he face next year?

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.470
Why, you!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.970
Let's celebrate!

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:49.730
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.250
Cut it out!

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.830
Hey, Yusaku! I'm home!

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:02.040
Nothing like a cold beer
after a hot bath!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.480
C'mon, everyone!
Let's party it up!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.260
Yeah!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.380
This looks like
the most auspicious day.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.130
That would be great.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:29.850
I'm so sorry that Shun is so busy,
he's asked me to take care

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.100
of all the engagement
ceremony arrangements.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.730
So I'll contact Shun and
give him the details.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.070
Great

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.030
Thank you for taking care
of everything.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.660
No problem.
This is like a hobby of mine.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:51.830
Shun's going to be
SO surprised

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.570
when he finds out that all
these decisions have been made.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.810
We've got a lot to do now.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.040
Yes.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:06.070
I'm so happy that I'm finally
going to be Mitaka's fiancée.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.850
All there is left to do now
is to convince Shun.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.930
Kyoko hasn't been
coming lately.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.360
Have you heard?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.940
I heard that Kyoko's
and Mitaka's parents.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:30.940
They met?

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.530
It's as though they're
getting married!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.680
Do you think
they're tying the knot?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:37.740
But.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.210
What's the prospect
with Asuna?

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.340
I wonder if Asuna
knows about this.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.570
Of course not!

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.550
If she did, all hell
would be breaking loose!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:57.320
One, two! One, two!
One, two! One, two!

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:06.950
I'm sorry, Asuna. I'm not
ready to give up Ms. Otonashi.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.970
Sorry, Coach!

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:38.110
You heard the rumor?

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.010
First of all,
please brace yourself.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.530
I should have told you myself.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.950
But I couldn't bring myself
to tell you.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.340
That rumor is true.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.950
I met Ms. Otonashi's parents
without telling you.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.560
I see.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:00.820
And uh.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:06.070
I realize you and I...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.130
I won't let it bother me.
After all, it's all in the past.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.570
No! We can't let it go at that

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:13.900
It's okay.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.840
After all, the formal
engagement ceremony date...

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.250
has already been set

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:37.520
Excuse me.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:38.860
Mitaka?

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.830
Could it be... That he hadn't heard
about the engagement ceremony?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:06:59.950
Bye!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.710
I thought you were going to
take some days off from work.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:09.650
Yes, but I have a class, and
I better at least attend.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.090
I see. Good luck.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:12.800
Thanks!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:17.590
I'll make dinner
for you tonight.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:20.130
R-Really?!

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.510
Yes. For you and
Your grandma.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.940
That's the least
I can do to help.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.840
Thank you very much.

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:35.450
I thought I'd find out from
Ms. Otonashi, but I can't!

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.570
I'll be back by evening.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.360
Have a good day!

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:53.830
I think we've met
once before...?

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:58.180
Perhaps.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.860
I see. So you met Mitaka
with hope of marriage.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.520
And what brought you
to Maison Ikkoku?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.280
I don't understand.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:16.860
What is going on between
Ms. Otonashi and Mitaka?

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.570
What do you mean?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:24.300
After their parents met, has
there been further progress?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.630
N-No way!

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:28.270
But.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.570
Are you not capable
of differentiating

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.580
between what you can
and cannot do?!

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.950
I apologize for going
ahead without telling you.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.450
Please call off the
engagement ceremony right now!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.060
That's impossible.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.320
Everyone's so happy.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.890
I can't just cancel simply
because YOU don't feel like it.

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:49.730
It's MY life!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:57.330
It's no use talking to you.
Good-bye.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:58.670
Where are you going?

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.640
Where else?
To the Kujo residence.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.460
Is this the Kujo residence?
This is Mitaka.

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:29.810
Just wanted to let you know
that Shun is on his way there,

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.460
and he may start
talking nonsense.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.950
But please pay no attention.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:38.650
What? Mr. and Mrs. Kujo
are attending

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:42.070
a relative's memorial service
and won't be home for three days?

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.650
I see! Well, good day, then.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.200
Lucky!

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.860
I'm afraid his relationship
with Ms. Otonashi

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.210
is moving toward marriage.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.840
But you're supposed to
marry him soon, aren't you?

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.610
Yes, but.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:20.710
Don't worry. Mitaka's not
such an irresponsible man.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:24.700
Once he makes up his mind,
he never backs down.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.990
Is that right..?

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:32.230
But if what she's
saying is true,

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.440
how indecisive of him!

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.300
That means he hasn't
given up on Manager!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.180
Mitaka!

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.660
What're you doing here?

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:29.980
I-I need to talk to you.

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:31.790
Sorry. Maybe another time.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.950
Hold it!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.900
I don't want to talk
to anyone right now!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.990
Asuna was crying.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.440
Are you a cohort, too?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.200
I don't know what
you're talking about,

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:50.200
but for someone who's slated
to be engaged to her.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.280
It's none of your business.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:56.480
It is! Stop confusing
the manager!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.850
I've been a good talker
since I was a little boy.

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.360
I've never lost
a verbal quarrel.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.800
It won't be fair for
a verbal cripple like you.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.310
What say we go
to a nearby park

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.450
and settle this
once and for all?

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:30.250
Sure. This is a crucial time
for both of us.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.630
Yusaku sure is late for someone
who starts finals tomorrow.

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:02.650
He told me he'd
be home by evening.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:06.240
Let's eat.
There's no point in waiting

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.370
and letting
your meal get cold.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:09.640
Yes.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.150
Kyoko, I'm sorry I'm not
home for dinner, after all.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:38.070
I'll try to end this quickly
and be there as soon as I can.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.410
I thought your hands
were only quick for women.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.420
And you can't even
get a dead leaf.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.840
I see victory will be mine.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.840
I won't let you concede, though.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.920
You can't crush me
like a dead leaf.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.980
I won't hold back.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:22.610
Kyoko, my final exams for
graduation start tomorrow...

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.440
I'm such an idiot.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.150
But I can't turn back now.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:58.890
Do you really want
to fight here?

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:01.170
Shall we keep walking?

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.860
Everywhere we go..

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:09.490
Hey!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:11.950
What are you up to?

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:16.240
What are you doing here?

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:17.430
What are your names?

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:18.130
Your addresses?

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:18.870
Hey!

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:21.770
Do we look like
Peeping Toms or thieves?

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.240
We're just looking for
a good place to fight!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:24.900
What?!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:26.880
Stupid! What're you saying?!

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:28.570
Let's go!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.350
Hey! Hold it!

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.130
How long is he
going to follow us?

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:48.150
What a pest.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:59.070
What say we have a drink
and toast to our friendship!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.700
Good idea!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.480
Cheers!

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.110
Don't you fight.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:06.620
We won't!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.650
You two better get along!

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.300
He's so lax.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.480
He told me he desperately
needed to study.

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:38.850
What is he doing?

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:45.220
Thank you!

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:52.450
It's that guy's!
What'll I do?

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.640
Did those two behave?

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.400
Officer!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.850
We've had a lot
of interruptions.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.550
Let's wrap it up quickly.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:17.910
Don't worry.
It'll just take one blow.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.750
Sorry, but I won't
go down so easily.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:21.920
Come on!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.630
Hey, you two!

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.060
See you!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:34.870
Hey!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:44.080
Hey!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:49.180
Hold it!

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:53.970
Hold it!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.830
I said, hold it!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.160
Wait!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.150
What does he want?

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:25.680
This is starting
to feel silly.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:37.140
I'll pay for it.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.310
I never said it's my treat.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.050
Hey!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.470
What's wrong with you,
Officer?!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.170
We're just enjoying
some drinks together.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.750
Then why did you run?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.890
You forgot your bag.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.420
Isn't this yours?

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:03.360
Y-Yes. Thank you.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.130
I do all this for you,

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.830
and who's gonna pay
for this broken bike?

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.930
You're such an airhead.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.230
Are you sure you're
going to graduate?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.850
Leave me alone!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:23.940
Here.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.550
You think this is going
to get you an upper hand?

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:30.480
Of course not

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:54.710
Why am I sitting around
drinking with you?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:58.980
I've got final exams
starting tomorrow, you know.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.010
For graduation?!

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.290
I hadn't been keeping up
in some classes,

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.560
so it's going to be tough.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.300
What are you doing here?!

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:11.120
Are you drunk, Mitaka?

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.220
You're the drunken one!

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.260
Who in his right mind
would be doing this

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:16.490
the day before his finals?!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.660
You're the one
who wanted to fight!

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:23.010
You think you can be
doing this and still graduate?

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:23.720
Yes.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.140
No, you won't.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.380
I definitely will!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:27.670
How could you?

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.400
Because I love Kyoko!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.090
I have to graduate for Kyoko!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.800
You stupid fool!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.070
Never mind. Go home already.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.430
I don't want you to blame me
when you fail to graduate.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:54.750
I WILL graduate!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:18.570
Damn! What a waste of my time!

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.460
It's pathetic
to have to compete

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.730
with an idiot like that.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:53.040
Why does Ms. Otonashi care
about that idiot?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.030
Asuna...

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:24.480
What brought you here?

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:28.330
Are you all right?

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:10.940
M-Manager..?

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.590
Have you been drinking?

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:24.290
Yes, a little.

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:52.380
What? Asuna went home
in the morning?

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:55.520
I heard she stayed over
at Coach Mitaka's condo.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.290
I'm envious!

00:23:57.430 --> 00:24:01.340
Next: "It Happened One Shocking Night!
Asuna's Salad Anniversary"

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:03.890
Who knows what a good girl
like that is capable of,

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:05.460
when she's prepared for war!
